id: supercomputer-command-mark
name: Mental Supercomputer
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 99
# Not a Combat Condition: Mental Supercomputer (3)'s - its 1(T), the Commander's Tier, as stacks.
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Mental Supercomputer: Combat Rolls higher by a point a stack, for the duration of your turn.
text: >
  (3)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: When you use the Command Maneuver, each targeted Minion has their Combat Rolls increased by 1(T) for the duration of their turn.

---

[passive per stack]
combatRolls += 1;
